EhOsContract.GraphRenderer
Copyright 2026 Empowered House PSA

This product includes software developed by third parties. `priv/static/eh_os_contract_graph.esm.js` is
built by esbuild from this package's own `assets/js/` and the two files under `assets/vendor/`, so it
carries all of the software below.

It is vendored rather than installed from npm because this repository deliberately carries no Node
toolchain: whoever edits the JS runs `mix assets.build`, which is esbuild alone.

